IEEE Consumer Communications & Networking Conference (CCNC) 2025 just ended. The conference was held in Las Vegas, Nevada, USA.
The conference was a great success with a large number of participants from all over the world, featuring a wide range of topics related to consumer communications and networking, including the latest research and developments in the field. 
The conference also featured 2 keynote speakers who shared their insights and expertise on various topics related to consumer communications and networking. 
Overall, the conference was a great opportunity for researchers, academics, and industry professionals to come together and share their knowledge and expertise in the field of consumer communications and networking. 
<br>
<h3>Prof. Luca Bedogni has been appointed as the TPC Vice-Chair for the 2026 edition.</h3>
<br>
We look forward to the next edition of the conference in 2026!
